OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Fat first this evening, but showers
OL,7,Fwill move in across the country from
OL,8,Fthe west overnight, these heavy at
OL,9,Ftimes, and possibly thundery in
OL,10,Fnorthern parts of Wales. Winds mostly
OL,11,Fgentle, with some clear spells.
OL,12,FFeeling cool.
OL,13,
OL,14,CThursday:FShowers will continue to
OL,15,Ffeed in from the north on Thursday,
OL,16,Fwhich could turn thundery at times.
OL,17,FShowers turning lighter and more
OL,18,Fisolated through the afternoon.
OL,19,FSlightly cooler than Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
