OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:
OL,6,FTemperatures staying below average
OL,7,Finto the weekend. Scattered showers
OL,8,Fcontinuing on Friday, but slowly
OL,9,Fbecoming more settled again heading
OL,10,Finto the weekend with an increasing
OL,11,Fnumber of sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
